{{Wikipedia|Kelly pool#Behind the eight ball|Behind the eight ball}}
==English==
===Noun===
'''[[behind]] [[the]] [[eight-ball]]'''
# {{slang}} In a tight spot, or difficult position.
===Etymology===
Derives from the game of [[W:Kelly pool|Kelly pool]], in which players assigned balls numerically higher than 8—that is, balls that are '''behind the 8 ball in order''—have little possibility of winning.